        "5": {
          "id": "5",
          "name": "requirements.md",
          "language": "md",
          "contents": "# UI Elements (Eco Actions)\n\n- **Image**: `main-image`\n- **Output text box**: `output`\n- **Buttons**:\n  - `water-btn` (Water)\n  - `energy-btn` (Energy)\n  - `transit-btn` (Transit)\n  - `food-btn` (Food)\n  - `reuse-btn` (Reuse)\n\n## Behavior\n- **Click a category button** updates `#output` with one tiny habit to try today for that category.\n- **App load** shows: \"Choose a category to get one tiny habit to try today.\"\n- **No console errors** and repeated clicks are safe.",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
